      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i've been taking 100mg of sertraline (zoloft) every day for about 3 years for my anxiety and it's been helping a lot. i recently hurt my lower back and my doctor suggested that i might be able to use tramadol for the pain. i'm a little worried though, is it actually safe to take tramadol while i'm on sertraline? i don't want to cause some kind of bad reaction.",
